1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,411
In eighteen sixteen, Laplace found the mistake.

2
00:00:03,411 --> 00:00:08,151
When a sound wave squeezes a layer of air, the layer warms up.

3
00:00:08,151 --> 00:00:10,885
When it stretches it, the layer cools.

4
00:00:10,885 --> 00:00:14,427
The question is whether that heat has time to escape.

